{"id":"ku_rze","lemma":"Kürze","pos":"noun","rank":3593,"glosses":["brevity","shortness"],"ipa":"/ˈkʏʁt͡sə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/76/De-K%C3%BCrze.ogg/De-K%C3%BCrze.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Kürze"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich werde Sie in Kürze anrufen.","en":"I'll call you soon.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390664","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to call, to ring"}]},{"text":"Der Vertrag läuft in Kürze aus.","en":"The contract will expire soon.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"contract, agreement"},null,{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Er wird in Kürze zurückkehren.","en":"He will be back before long.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to return"}]},{"text":"Das Flugzeug wird in Kürze landen.","en":"The plane will land before long.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"aeroplane"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to land"}]},{"text":"In der Kürze liegt die Würze.","en":"Brevity is the soul of wit.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"to season","l":"würzen"}]}]}